			<td class="textmode">202200132</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">MR OFFICE</td><td class="textmode">21</td><td class="textmode">During the internal Audit, the Exclusion Under the Scope of IMS was found to be not in line with the Scope Statement.
The Exclusions under Scope of IMS states that, &quot;The organization is into Manufacture &amp; Supply of Coke and by products as per requirements and specification which does not require and include design and development.&quot; , whereas the Scope states that &quot;Manufacture &amp; Supply of Ferro Alloys, Stainless Steel sheets and rolled Products
(Hot &amp; Cold Rolled) and Generation of Thermal Power (Captive).&quot;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 4.3</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OBS</td><td class="textmode">Scope is to be correctly mention in Apex manual.</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Scope  correctly mentioned in Apex manual</td><td class="textmode">Not applicable. As per existing apex procedure, Root cause analysis is done only for non- conformities</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Please update the root cause analysis</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202200133</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">MR OFFICE</td><td class="textmode">21</td><td class="textmode">While reviewing competency mapping of Mr Jibanendu Tripathy who is listed as an qualified internal auditor as per doc no. JSL/F/IATF/9.2.2/4 , was not found to be inline with the requirement.
Education is not considered while preparing the Competency mapping vide document no. JSL/F/IATF/9.2.2/4 (a).</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 7.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OBS</td><td class="textmode">Competency mapping record is to reviewed and updated</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Competency mapping record reviewed and updated</td><td class="textmode">Not Applicable</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">During the internal audit, the competency mapping was shown vide format no. JSL/F/IATF/9.2.2/4. However as per the attachment, the format number JSL/F/MR/9.2.2/4. There is no date of review in the document. Need clarification. Also plz share the copy of amendment history sheet </td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202200134</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">MR OFFICE</td><td class="textmode">21</td><td class="textmode">Periodic Awareness/ Training to internal auditors are not evident at the time of the internal audit.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 7.3</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OBS</td><td class="textmode">Internal Auditors certified of newly trained personnel is to be made available</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Internal Auditors certified of newly trained personnel is  made available</td><td class="textmode">Not applicable</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Kindly share the root cause analysis. Also kindly share the annual training/ awareness plan for internal auditors apart from the newly trained personnel.</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202200135</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">MR OFFICE</td><td class="textmode">21</td><td class="textmode">While reviewing the previous Management review meeting report held on 3rd November 2021, it was found that the report is not documented as on 31.12.2021</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/7.5.3.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OBS</td><td class="textmode">MRM 20 is to be well documented</td><td class="textmode">15-01-2022</td><td class="textmode">MRM 20 is well documented </td><td class="textmode">Not Applicable</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Document is not uploaded. Also kindly share the root cause analysis</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202200136</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">MR OFFICE</td><td class="textmode">21</td><td class="textmode">The process of internal audit was not found to be effective.
Internal audit effectiveness w.r.t audit schedule could not be demonstrated at the time of internal audit.
While conducting internal audit, it was found that the reporting categories i.e. NC/OBS/OFI  are not properly defined.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/9.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">NC</td><td class="textmode">Procedure of internal Audit will be reviewed and updated in Apex manual.</td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Procedure of internal Audit reviewed and updated in Apex manual.</td><td class="textmode">Why 1 - Internal Audit planning not done as per defined process. Why 2 - Internal Audit Process adequacy review w.r.t release of audit schedule is not done. Why 3 - Process not reviewed as per current prevailing practices </td><td class="textmode">17-03-2022</td><td class="textmode">Wrong document attached. Kindly do why why analysis for atleast 3rd why. Plz upload the actual document.</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
