			<td class="textmode">202300421</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">24</td><td class="textmode">The department has monitored customers&#39; perceptions of the degree to which their needs and expectations have been fulfilled however reviewing this information may be strengthen. (Evidence - (i) Name of department/Supplier was not clearly identified (ii) SLA for CGS and AWS was not evident).</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 9.1.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">Since the activity for FY23 has been completed thus document has been manually updated. Going forward shall be updated at the time of review.</td><td class="textmode">15-07-2023</td><td class="textmode">Since the activity for FY23 has been completed thus document has been manually updated.</td><td class="textmode">Not written the Dept Name at the time SLA</td><td class="textmode">27-08-2023</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
