			<td class="textmode">202300422</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">24</td><td class="textmode">The department has retained documented information on the process and on the plans for responding to potential emergency situations however it has to be updated as appropriate. (Evidence - Emergency Command structure was not updated)</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/8.2 </td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/8.2</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">As suggest, the document has been reviewed jointly with Safety department and necessary changes has been update as per guidelines and record updated accordingly.</td><td class="textmode">15-07-2023</td><td class="textmode">As suggest, the document has been reviewed jointly with Safety department and necessary changes has been update as per guidelines and record updated accordingly.</td><td class="textmode">Not provided by concerned dept. at the time of Audit</td><td class="textmode">27-08-2023</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202300423</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">24</td><td class="textmode">Organization Chart to be reviewed as per the current existing structure.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 5.3</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Organization chart updated.</td><td class="textmode">15-07-2023</td><td class="textmode">Organization chart updated.</td><td class="textmode">Not updated at the time of Audit due to some employee left the organization.</td><td class="textmode">27-08-2023</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
