			<td class="textmode">202400044</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">Department has maintained the HIRA, Quality Risk &amp; Aspect Impact document and also provided awareness training to the department employees However HIRA , Aspect Impact and Quality Risk document to be reviewed.(Evidence - In HIRA Document risk score for Hot area/Hot work( before-20, after-10)  (Evidence-. Last HIRA Reviewed on 31.03.2023. In Aspect Impact document risk score for storage of used oil (Before-64 &amp; After-48). (Evidence- Last Aspect Impact reviewed on 31.03.2023)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/6.1.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/ 6.1.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/6.1.1</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">HIRA Document to be reviewed properly as per Revised Risk Level and Aspect Impact Document to be reviewed as per Residual Score</td><td class="textmode">15-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">HIRA &amp; Aspect Impact document reviewed.</td><td class="textmode">The score was reduced based on the following parametres.(1)Proper mitigation measures strengthen like Hot appron,Permit to work,Fire Extinguisher,Hydrant Line for HIRA and Separate storage under shed developed along with cheking done once in month for Aspect Impact.(2)Past history where NO incidenet placed.</td><td class="textmode">21-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">In the HIRA document the control measures for hot work should be documented in HIRA. Kindly add the points in HIRA and revert.</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400045</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">Department has maintained the list of Illumination and Earth Pit Record However  Department has not achieved the target for Illumination Lux  for Room No.-2 . (Evidence- Target value-60 , Actual Value-49. Illumination document last reviewed on-15.12.2023).</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/7.1.4</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/8.1.1</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Illumination Record to be updated properly with achieved target level</td><td class="textmode">15-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">Illumination record maintained.</td><td class="textmode">Previously one light not working at Room/2,so that lux level reducced.Later all lighting system repaired and illumination lux level updated as per recomonded.</td><td class="textmode">21-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">The Illumination has crossed the acceptable limit. Kindly recheck and upload the same.</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400046</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">Department has maintained the performance rating of outsourced job/ Vendor evaluation however Vendor rating is not evident from April 2023 onwards.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/8.4.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/7.5.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/7.5.2</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Performance rating of Outsourced job/Vendor evaluation to be updated .</td><td class="textmode">15-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">Performance rating of Outsourced job/Vendor evaluation updated .</td><td class="textmode">Vendor evaluation was in progress, hence not presented to Auditor .Now record has maintained.</td><td class="textmode">21-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">Point is evident</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400047</td><td class="textmode">INVENTORY &amp; SUPPLY MANAGEMENT</td><td class="textmode">I &amp; SM</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">Department has maintained the list of Continual Improvements Projects however as on date status has not being updated. (Evidence- List of Improvement Projects).</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/10.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/10.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/10.3</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Status of continual improvement project status to be updated</td><td class="textmode">15-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">List of Continual Improvement Project updated</td><td class="textmode">Status of Continual Improvement Project was in progress,hence not presented to Auditor.Now record has maintained.</td><td class="textmode">21-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">Point is evident</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400048</td><td class="textmode">QA CTL</td><td class="textmode">QA CTL</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">The Department has  well defined organization chart however Department has not addressed the roles and responsibilities of departmental head. (Evidence- Site in Charge for environment &amp; waste disposal not addressed, I/C CTL LAB not defined properly, roles and responsibility of HOD &amp; assistant HOD not addressed )</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/5.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/5.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/5.3</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">Roles and responsibility will be review as per organization chart .</td><td class="textmode">30-01-2024</td><td class="textmode">Role and responsibility has been added</td><td class="textmode">Internal Audit</td><td class="textmode">31-01-2024</td><td class="textmode">Found to be adequate.</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
