			<td class="textmode">202400242</td><td class="textmode">CGS</td><td class="textmode">CGS Operation</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">The department has controlled documented information however it shall also ensure appropriate review and approval for suitability and adequacy while creating and updating documented information. (Evidence - (i) Record No - JSL / F/ CGS - M / 09 n (ii) Manpower Entry (iii)Work Urgency Reports (iv)Customer feed back (v) Tools receiving register (vi) Retention period of Spare list (vii) Machines history card doc no - JSL / F/ CGS/ - M / 03</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 7.5.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">i) Record no - JSL/F/CGS - O/ 09 updated on receiving register. ii) Manpower entry record updated. iii) Target date &amp; actual date updated on urgency report. iv) Customer feed back received from user department. v) Tool register record no updated. vi) Machine spare part retention period for 5 years. vii) Machine history card updated.</td><td class="textmode">16-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">All records updated</td><td class="textmode">Review was not adequately performed. </td><td class="textmode">04-03-2024</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
