		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400244</td><td class="textmode">CGS</td><td class="textmode">CGS Operation</td><td class="textmode">25</td><td class="textmode">The department has to maintain the processes needed to meet EMSby implementing control of processes in accordance with oprerating criteria. (SOP for waste disposal may be revised as per the current practice.)</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/ 8.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">SOP made for Waste disposal &amp; will be added on DPM.</td><td class="textmode">12-02-2024</td><td class="textmode">SOP of waste disposal revised</td><td class="textmode">Not review previously</td><td class="textmode">04-03-2024</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
