			<td class="textmode">202400246</td><td class="textmode">Central Utility</td><td class="textmode">CEU</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">The department has maintained and ensured that equipment remains in condition that is necessary for the operation of its processes; however maintenance related activities needs improvement to achieve conformity of products and services. (Evidence - while verifying Preventive maintenance checklist , most of the measurable checkpoints were not having min/max limit. e.g PM of liquid propane decanting compressor -03, Oil level value was missing)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 7.1.3</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">To be reviewed</td><td class="textmode">25-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">reviewed</td><td class="textmode">not reviewed</td><td class="textmode">22-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">not attached evidence and with do not taken root cause analysis</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400247</td><td class="textmode">Central Utility</td><td class="textmode">CEU</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">Critical spare parts are available however no action plan evidence in case of non-achievement of minimum stock level which can support the continuous operation of production and service processes. (Evidence Basis of defining criticality was not available , List of critical spare format not controlled, action plan not available for zero stock level)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 8.5.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Major NC</td><td class="textmode">To be reviewed</td><td class="textmode">25-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">reviewed</td><td class="textmode">not reviewed</td><td class="textmode">22-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">evidence not attached </td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400248</td><td class="textmode">Central Utility</td><td class="textmode">CEU</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">The department has not ensured that lifting equipment is appropriately certified and that records of inspections and maintenance are kept up to date (Evidence - Lifting tools and tackles certificate was found due on 10.04.2024)</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, 8.1.2</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">To be reviewed</td><td class="textmode">25-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">reviewed</td><td class="textmode">not reviewed</td><td class="textmode">23-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400249</td><td class="textmode">Central Utility</td><td class="textmode">CEU</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">The department has not kept up to date the calibration schedule. Calibration certificate no. may also be included in the list. (Evidence - Equipment Id - PSV 105 found due on 07.06.2024).</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/ 7.1.5.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">To be reviewed</td><td class="textmode">25-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">reviewed</td><td class="textmode">not reviewed</td><td class="textmode">22-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">Evidence not attached</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400250</td><td class="textmode">Central Utility</td><td class="textmode">CEU</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">The department has implemented and maintained the processes needed to meet OH&amp;S management system requirements but taking a work permit was not mentioned in all maintenance related work. (Evidence - Taking Work permit in WI for maintenance of centrifugal pump was missing).</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode"> ISO 45001:2018/ 8.1.1</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">To be reviwed</td><td class="textmode">25-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">reviewed</td><td class="textmode">not reviewed</td><td class="textmode">22-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">Evidence not attached</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
