(ii)CCA against abnormal vibration noted in ID Fan 6MT-IF. Corrective action noted as Inspection and cleaning done twice a month however report for the same was not available.
(iii) Breakdown &quot; Mechanical delay due to mould water leakage dated 21.07.2023&quot; was not recorded in SAP. (Analysis report was reported on 04.05.2024 in SAP)&#160;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001: 2018/10.2</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">i) HIRA to be reviewed for covering work at height at main cooling Tower. 
ii) ID fan Inspection &amp; cleaning schedule to be implemented.
iii) Breakdown report to be recorded in SAP by 10th of every month after operation delay sheet finalization.
</td><td class="textmode">16-11-2024</td><td class="textmode">i) HIRA has been reviewed. ii) Monthly Equipment Cleaning schedule has been prepared. iii) Breakdown report SAP entry has been done.</td><td class="textmode">Monthly review to be done.</td><td class="textmode">03-01-2025</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
