		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400480</td><td class="textmode">Coke Oven</td><td class="textmode">COBP E &amp; A</td><td class="textmode">14</td><td class="textmode">Preventive maintenance date 02.01.2024 , 4002617426 was found to be opened in SAP.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, 8.5.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Maintenance work order no-4002617426 closed in SAP &amp; continuously checking of any pending work order input in SAP. </td><td class="textmode">30-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">Maintenance work order closed in SAP</td><td class="textmode">Proper training not provided</td><td class="textmode">30-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400481</td><td class="textmode">Coke Oven</td><td class="textmode">COBP E &amp; A</td><td class="textmode">14</td><td class="textmode">The department has not ensured competency of personal working or performing specific tasks (Evidence-training calendar was not in line with the topics covered in competency mapping of individuals)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015,7.1.6</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">The training calendar has been aligned with the training given to the individual person.</td><td class="textmode">30-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">all the trainings will be given to the individuals according to the training calendar </td><td class="textmode">training calendar was not  reviewed</td><td class="textmode">30-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400482</td><td class="textmode">Coke Oven</td><td class="textmode">COBP E &amp; A</td><td class="textmode">14</td><td class="textmode">The department has not taken corrective action against the reported external audit findings.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015,10.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">PM checklist reviewed and maintained.</td><td class="textmode">30-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">PM checklist are continuously review &amp; maintain </td><td class="textmode">PM checklist are not updated </td><td class="textmode">30-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400483</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP C&amp; I</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">During the audit, it was observed that equipment no. 9050020663 (HR valve for Unit-2), classified as critical (Category A), lacked a defined preventive maintenance (PM) schedule. There was no evidence of any previous PM activities conducted. As per ISO 14001:2015, clause 8.1, it is imperative to establish, implement, and maintain processes to ensure that the equipment&#39;s operational control is effectively managed. The absence of a PM schedule for critical equipment poses a risk to operational efficiency and environmental management. Immediate action is required to develop and document a PM schedule for this critical equipment.</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015, clause 8.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">PM PLAN REVIEW &amp; CHECK POINT REVIEW</td><td class="textmode">29-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">CRH-2 V/V,U#2 IS ADDED IN PM SCHEDULE, &amp; ALSO PM PLAN REVIEWED ,WHICH IMPROVE OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCY</td><td class="textmode">MISSING OF PM ACTIVITIES OF CRH-2 V/V,U#2 IN PM PLAN IDENTIFIED</td><td class="textmode">29-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">DOCUMENT OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400484</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP C&amp; I</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">During the audit, it was noted that the department has defined the identification of safety observations (SOS) as a key performance indicator (KPI). However, the SOS reporting was only 2 in June and 2 in May, indicating a low rate of identification. According to ISO 14001:2015, clause 9.1, the organization must monitor, measure, analyze, and evaluate its environmental performance. To meet the requirements and improve safety, the department must implement strategies to increase SOS reporting, ensuring a proactive approach to identifying and addressing safety issues. Immediate action is recommended to enhance SOS identification processes.</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015, clause 9.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">NOS OF SOS POINT INCREMENT</td><td class="textmode">29-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">NOS OF SOS REPORTING ARE INCREASED</td><td class="textmode">SOS REPORTING WAS VERY LESS</td><td class="textmode">29-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">DOCUMENT OK.</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400485</td><td class="textmode">CRMHS</td><td class="textmode">CRMHS</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">QEOHS policy may be displayed in vernacular language(E.g.- Policy maybe printed in odiya language.)</td><td class="textmode">iso 9001:2015, 5.2.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Not available only English language available. </td><td class="textmode">08-08-2024</td><td class="textmode">Updated</td><td class="textmode">NA</td><td class="textmode">06-08-2024</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202400486</td><td class="textmode">CRMHS</td><td class="textmode">CRMHS</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">Process flow for planning of changes may be reviewed (PFD may be added to show the flow.)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, 6.3</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Updated in DPM.</td><td class="textmode">08-08-2024</td><td class="textmode">Updated</td><td class="textmode">NA</td><td class="textmode">06-08-2024</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
