			<td class="textmode">202400492</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">QA TS</td><td class="textmode">26</td><td class="textmode">The Department has maintained the Participation of workers in HIRA Training However Minutes of Meeting points were not recorded.</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001: 2018/5.4</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The MOM points shall be recorded in the next review meeting of HIRA.</td><td class="textmode">13-08-2024</td><td class="textmode">The MOM points shall be recorded in the next review meeting of HIRA.</td><td class="textmode">It was already in practice. However, the same was not documented.</td><td class="textmode">29-10-2024</td><td class="textmode">Ok however please carry out the cause analysis and take corrective action accordingly</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
