			<td class="textmode">202500026</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has maintained the list of internal &amp; external issues however the wording related to Audit Observation in external issues should be clearly defined and include aspects like manpower availability within internal issues.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 4.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 4.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 4.1</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Manpower availability to be added on Internal issues and the wording related to Audit Observation to be cleared.</td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500027</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has maintained the list of Needs and Expectations of Interested parties howeverThe inclusion of Admin, IT, and Store departments should be reviewed as interested parties, ensuring that all relevant stakeholders are accounted for.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 4.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 4.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 4.2</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode"> Admin, IT, and Store departments to be added on the list of Needs and Expectations of Interested parties.</td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500028</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has defined the scope however  the scope of the management system should be clearly defined, covering all relevant activities, including the generation and supply of power to MRSS.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 4.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 4.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 4.3</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The generation and supply of power to MRSS to be added on the scope of DPM.</td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500029</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has adddressed the roles and responsibilities  in the organogram chart however The roles and responsibilities of HOD (Operation) and HOD (Power Plant) should be clearly stated in the organogram.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 5.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 5.3</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 5.3</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The roles and responsibilities to be modified in the organogram.</td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500030</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has maintained the Objective and KPI However The objective related to specific coal consumption and safety KPIs related to zero accidents should be incorporated.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 6.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 6.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 6.2</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Specific coal consumption to be added on Objective and zero accidents to be removed from KPI.</td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500031</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has maintained the Quality Risk and HIRA Document however The addition of specific risks like sudden breakdown of CPP in the Quality Risk document and the application of control measures in the HIRA document should be considered.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 6.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 6.1</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 6.1</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Sudden breakdown of CPP to be added on Quality Risk </td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500032</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The department has imparted trainings to there working personnel and also maintained training record for the same. However Training effectiveness records should be maintained to assess the success of the training programs.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/Clause 7.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015/Clause 7.2</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/Clause 7.2</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Training effectiveness records to be maintained.</td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500033</td><td class="textmode">Ferro Alloys</td><td class="textmode">FA Operation</td><td class="textmode">27</td><td class="textmode">The Department has establish HIRA implement and maintained but however consultation and
participation of worker during HIRA review Workmen need more involvement and attendance maintained.</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, 5.4</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">training record </td><td class="textmode">28-02-2025</td><td class="textmode">more vender representative involved in HIRA</td><td class="textmode">more vender representative involved in HIRA</td><td class="textmode">05-03-2025</td><td class="textmode">ok however minutes of meeting may also be prepared and complied to</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
