			<td class="textmode">202500257</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP EM</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">The department maintained work permit however some work permit remain open in SAP(Document No : JRD0192102, U-2 COP-2 feedback checking, Dt- 29.03.2025)</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, 6.1.3</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">The department shall review all open work permits in SAP and ensure closure of completed permits.A periodic review will be done to avoid recurrence of such issues.</td><td class="textmode">10-10-2025</td><td class="textmode">PTW was closed and technically completed after Backdate Approval</td><td class="textmode">Job was carried out overnight but there was no scheme implemented in SAP for that case.</td><td class="textmode">17-10-2025</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500258</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP EM</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">As of the time of the Audit found,  PM order for the months of May and June remain open.( order no-4003114894, ESP purge air blower created on 10.05.2025)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, 8.5.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">The pending PM Orders have been closed. However, monitoring will be conducted to ensure timely closure of PM orders moving forward.</td><td class="textmode">10-10-2025</td><td class="textmode">PM order was closed and similar orders on the month of May &amp; June 2025 were also closed. </td><td class="textmode">Equipment was required to be in service for seamless production. </td><td class="textmode">17-10-2025</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500259</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP EM</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">The department maintained, MTTR &amp; MTBF file however Total hrs file to be updated(E.g. Feb- 31 days)</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, 9.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The MTTR &amp; MTBF file has been reviewed &amp; updated.</td><td class="textmode">10-10-2025</td><td class="textmode">MTTR &amp; MTBF File was updated accordingly.</td><td class="textmode">Total Hours column was not reviewed.</td><td class="textmode">17-10-2025</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500261</td><td class="textmode">SMS</td><td class="textmode">SMS Operation</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">The department has identified and taken action against the cause of a minor injury in the index finger of a technician reported on 06.04.2025; however, the proposed action is not appropriately identified, which indicates that the action taken is not effective. 
Evidence: Accident Investigation Report, Accident held on 06.04.2025.</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018/10.2</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">The action is properly identified which can be evident from the report. Since the issue has not been repeated again, hence action taken is effective we can conclude. However as suggested after re-discussion with Safety team we will change Root Cause wordings.</td><td class="textmode">15-08-2025</td><td class="textmode">Root cause wordings have been changed.</td><td class="textmode">Wordings changed to make it more professional.</td><td class="textmode">14-08-2025</td><td class="textmode">Please attach CCA report</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500262</td><td class="textmode">SMS</td><td class="textmode">SMS Operation</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">The department has taken corrective action against the nonachievement of the production target for the months of May and June 2025; however, the root causes identified in the corrective action taken are not found to be appropriately related to the root cause of the problem. The department may carry out a fresh RCA to identify the correct root cause of the problem, which appears to be related to maintenance practices and risk mitigation. Evidence: The objectives of the months of May and June 2025 were not achieved in the monitoring sheet.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/6.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The root cause has been accepted by Top management and OEM and since it is design related issue FMEA has been prepared and accordingly action plan has been prepared to address the issue. Since issue is related to CAPEX approval, it has been delayed to close the issue. </td><td class="textmode">15-08-2025</td><td class="textmode">Action plan has been implemented to minimize the effect and further to zeroed the effect.</td><td class="textmode">Kamag Design Issue</td><td class="textmode">14-08-2025</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500263</td><td class="textmode">SMS</td><td class="textmode">SMS Operation</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">The department may consider reviewing the training plan to cover all relevant topics and the maximum number of participants. Evidence: Training record for the month of June 2025 (12.6.2025).</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015/7.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">Training schedule already has been prepared accordingly in the FY start. Each month we are sharing the training details ot Training center on month-on-month basis. However we will further try to include more and more no. of employees.</td><td class="textmode">15-08-2025</td><td class="textmode">More employees have been added to trainings</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">14-08-2025</td><td class="textmode">OK</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500264</td><td class="textmode">Central QA</td><td class="textmode">QA TS</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">IMS Scope of the department with regards to outsourced services may be reviewed to align with the present scope of departmental activities.
