			<td class="textmode">202500408</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP C&amp; I</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">During the audit, it was observed that the Compliance Manager is referenced in the DPM; however, it is not actively used for maintaining compliance reports. This is a deviation from IMS Clause 9.1 (Monitoring, Measurement, Analysis, and Evaluation) and Clause 7.5 (Documented Information). Corrective action is recommended.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, 9.1</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">DOCUMENT UPDATION</td><td class="textmode">30-09-2025</td><td class="textmode">DPM Updated</td><td class="textmode">NA</td><td class="textmode">27-09-2025</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500409</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP C&amp; I</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">A discrepancy was found between the DPM and SLA document JSL/F/MR/4.2 regarding the revaluation period. The DPM specifies a 6-month interval, while the SLA document mentions 1 year.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, 8.2</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">DOCUMENT UPDATION</td><td class="textmode">30-09-2025</td><td class="textmode">Need and expectation file updated</td><td class="textmode">NA</td><td class="textmode">27-09-2025</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202500410</td><td class="textmode">CPP</td><td class="textmode">CPP C&amp; I</td><td class="textmode">28</td><td class="textmode">The HIRA document JSL/F/HIRA/6.1 was last updated on 24/04/2025. While the participant list for the review meeting is available, the signatures of participants were not obtained. This is a nonconformance to IMS Clause 7.5 (Documented Information) and Clause 5.1 (Leadership and Commitment). Proper documentation of participation is required.</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, 5.1</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">DOCUMENT UPDATION</td><td class="textmode">30-09-2025</td><td class="textmode">HIRA document updated</td><td class="textmode">NA</td><td class="textmode">27-09-2025</td><td class="textmode">ok</td><td class="textmode">CLOSE</td>
