</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, Clause 4.2
</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The Department has identified the needs and expectations of interested parties; however, HSM, CRM, FA, and other related activities will be duly incorporated into the list to ensure all relevant parties are comprehensively addressed.																								
</td><td class="textmode">20-02-2026</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202600149</td><td class="textmode">Logistics</td><td class="textmode">Log</td><td class="textmode">29</td><td class="textmode">QEOHS Policy was not available at the time of the audit.</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, Clause 5.2
</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015, Clause 5.2
</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, Clause 5.2
</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The QEOHS Policy was not available at the time of the audit; however, it is currently under preparation and will be formally issued and made available in the coming days.</td><td class="textmode">20-02-2026</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
			<td class="textmode">202600150</td><td class="textmode">Logistics</td><td class="textmode">Log</td><td class="textmode">29</td><td class="textmode">The Department monitors objectives and key performance indicators however back up documents in support of the monitoring parameters may be maintained.
</td><td class="textmode">ISO 9001:2015, Clause 6.2.2
</td><td class="textmode">ISO 14001:2015, Clause 6.2.2
</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, Clause 6.2.2
</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The Department currently monitors its objectives and key performance indicators; however, the entire set of objectives is under review and will be revised in the coming days, along with the necessary supporting documentation.																							
</td><td class="textmode">20-02-2026</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
		</tr><tr style="color:#000066;background-color:White;">
