</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">Minor NC</td><td class="textmode">The environmental monitoring records, including the illumination checklist and earth pit resistivity monitoring schedule/checklists, were already maintained; however, they were not readily available for presentation at the time of the audit and will be shared shortly for review.																													
