</td><td class="textmode">ISO 45001:2018, Clause7.2
</td><td class="textmode">OFI</td><td class="textmode">The Department has conducted the required training programs, and competency mapping, approved training calendar, and attendance records are duly maintained; however, the relevant file was not available at the time of the audit and will be provided for verification.</td><td class="textmode">20-02-2026</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">&nbsp;</td><td class="textmode">OPEN</td>
